+## Project voice default (ML 補習影片)
+
+Default narration voice for this project is OpenRouter `google/gemini-3.8-flash-tts`, voice `Enceladus`
+(warm Taiwan-Mandarin teacher instructions), via `core/tts/tts_openrouter.py` (same out_dir contract as
+`tts_zh.py`: `<id>.wav`, `dur.json`). Needs `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` in the environment. Fallback:
+`tts_zh.py --voice zh-TW-HsiaoChenNeural`. See /workspace/video_style/VOICE.md.
